d 'MKES': module to generate English oral sentences from a user-supplied prompt phrase
d
d	mkes is a spoken English sentence generator. Provide a
d short daily-English prompt phrase -- for example, "There is no",
d "I	want to", or "Can you" -- and the program automatically
d produces sentences sharing the same grammatical structure. Every 
d   English sentence is paired with a complete Chinese translation,
d so learners see the full meaning at a glance. 
d
d KW: translation
d KW: English
d KW: Chinese
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260820
d
d Author: Wu LiangHai,  Anhui University of Technology
d Support: email agd2010@@yeah.net
d
d Author:   Wu Hanyan, Nanjing University of Aeronautics and Astronautics
d Support: email    2325476320@@qq.com
d
f mkes.ado
f mkes.sthlp
f ../s/sunny_test.do
